description: Merge to main and deploy when tests pass
alwaysApply: true
---

# Merge + deploy rule

When lint, typecheck, production build, and CI are green on the working branch:

1. Commit and push the working branch.
2. Merge into `main` (`git push origin HEAD:main` or merge the PR).
3. Confirm production deploy (Vercel follows `main`).

Do **not** leave shippable work only on a feature branch. Tests OK = merge + deploy in the same turn.

If CI is red, do not merge. Fix, push, re-run, then merge.
